        {
          "text": "You are a senior business intelligence analyst specializing in e-commerce businesses in India. You have been given one week of business data from an e-commerce brand.

Here is the structured data:
{{ $json.structured_summary }}

Your task is to analyze this data deeply and produce a business intelligence report.

Analysis requirements:
1. Identify the top 3 performance trends this week (positive or negative)
2. Flag any anomalies or warning signs that the business owner must pay attention to
3. Analyze customer sentiment based on ratings and review content
4. Assess support ticket load and identify any systemic issues
5. Give exactly 2 specific, actionable recommendations the business owner should implement THIS week — not generic advice, specific actions based on the data

Respond ONLY with a valid JSON object in this exact format, no extra text, no markdown, no code blocks:
{
  "executive_summary": "3-4 sentence overview of the week",
  "top_trends": [
    {"trend": "description", "impact": "positive or negative", "data_point": "specific number that supports this"}, 
    {"trend": "description", "impact": "positive or negative", "data_point": "specific number"},
    {"trend": "description", "impact": "positive or negative", "data_point": "specific number"}
  ],
  "anomalies": ["anomaly 1", "anomaly 2"],
  "customer_sentiment": {"overall": "Positive/Neutral/Negative", "summary": "2 sentence sentiment analysis"},
  "support_health": {"status": "Healthy/At Risk/Critical", "summary": "1-2 sentence support assessment"},
  "recommendation_1": {"action": "specific action title", "detail": "exactly what to do and why based on the data"},
  "recommendation_2": {"action": "specific action title", "detail": "exactly what to do and why based on the data"}
}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "generationConfig": {
    "temperature": 0.4,
    "maxOutputTokens": 1500
  }
}

